          "text": "Témoignages: CLERMONT-FERRAND (63) 19.09.1991",
          "text_sha256": "913fd97bfc7913ca109a55ebec4a6b31436b5cf82e02deaec7e222b39f299cea"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
